Lumaretouch modifications, 2026-10-22: heuristic clothes-mask generation is not
included. Explicit MediaPipe six-class semantic clothing support is used instead;
non-clothing pixels are excluded after measurement. Colour transforms run locally
without the upstream parallel scheduler. CPU measurement is cached; slider gain
runs on the existing Torch device. Full-size export measures the complete image
once before slicing the same field into export tiles.

This corrects fine fabric shading, not garment synthesis or full wrinkle removal.
